      "name": "mcp__evimed__research_calculate",
      "source": "mcp",
      "description": "Compute frozen aggregate JSON with an admitted deterministic engine. inputPath is a JSON file in its method's shape, written here with ? after an optional key and | between a key's alternatives; a missing key, or one the engine does not read, fails the calculation. meta.dl {studies[{id,label,yi,vi}],effectMeasure:MD|SMD|RD|OR|RR|HR|IRR,outcome} -- two or more studies with distinct ids; yi is a study's effect on the analysis scale (the natural log for OR, RR, HR, IRR) and vi its variance, above 0. faers.signals {tables[{id,a,b,c,d}]} -- 2x2 counts, integers of 0 or more, one table per id: a the drug with the event, b the drug with other events, c other drugs with the event, d other drugs with other events; optional parameters yates, correctZeroCells. bibliometric.network {edges[{source,target,weight,source_freq,target_freq}]} -- each pair once; weight is the pair's co-occurrence count, source_freq and target_freq each node's own frequency, all above 0; parameters.maxNodes is required. design.analytic {scenario:{design{kind:two_arm_fixed},endpoint{type:continuous},truth{effect,sd?},analysis?{alpha?,power?,sided?}}|{design{kind:two_arm_fixed},endpoint{type:binary},truth{controlRate,treatmentRate}}|{design{kind:two_arm_fixed},endpoint{type:time_to_event},truth{hazardRatio,controlMedian}}|{design{kind:group_sequential,informationRates[]},endpoint{type:time_to_event},truth{hazardRatio,controlMedian}}|{design{kind:simon_two_stage},endpoint{type:binary},truth{nullRate,alternativeRate}}|{design{kind:single_arm,n},endpoint{type:binary},truth{nullRate,responseRate},analysis{method:exact_binomial,alternative:greater|less}}} -- the optional analysis fits every two_arm_fixed and group_sequential scenario and defaults to alpha 0.025 in total, power 0.9, sided 1; sd defaults to 1; informationRates rise to 1. comparator.evalue {scenario{riskRatio,confidenceLimit?,scale?:risk_ratio|odds_ratio|hazard_ratio,rare?}} -- riskRatio is the estimate on that scale and confidenceLimit the interval limit nearer 1; rare reads an odds or hazard ratio of a rare outcome as a risk ratio. action=start/status/cancel; completed results preserve input/code/environment identities and original bytes. No scripts, retrieval, fitted EBGM prior or patient rows. action=render fills a report template's {{n:alias.key|f2}} references from machine values into a NEW file.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
